# Ceiling: the stack plus the top 6% of adults consuming at the c_ref the ladders' targets were defined for
# (a target is the effective rate for an accumulator consuming c_ref = 1%; the other scenarios simulate everyone at
# c = 3.5%, which realises roughly a third of the target). Others absorb, so mean consumption stays at c.
# NEEDS A CITATION for saving rates at the top; keep it labelled as the ceiling, not the central case.
